review_comment:
@abaicus, @girishpanchal30 

> Here when we toggle the respective settings, the sidebar widget is not updated unless you save the settings. I think this might be confusing to users.

I don't think this is a problem. For a feature to work you need to save it so only enabling and changing the status could be even more confusing that you already enabled it and don't need to save the settings anymore. So IMO it's fine and we can keep it this way.

