_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

_⚠️ Potential issue_

**Validate `messageEvent.origin` before processing to prevent malicious redirects.**

Right now, any window can post a message that triggers `window.location.href`, leading to open-redirect or navigation attacks. You should compare `messageEvent.origin` to the trusted iframe origin and ignore unexpected sources.  


Example within the handler:
```diff
 function _komodoOnMessageHandler(messageEvent) {
+  const iframeSrc = document.getElementById('fiat-onramp-iframe').src;
+  const trustedOrigin = new URL(iframeSrc).origin;
+  if (messageEvent.origin !== trustedOrigin) {
+    console.warn('Ignored message from untrusted origin:', messageEvent.origin);
+    return;
+  }
   let messageData;
   try {
     messageData = typeof messageEvent.data === 'string'
       ? JSON.parse(messageEvent.data)
       : messageEvent.data;
   } catch (parseError) {
     messageData = messageEvent.data;
   }
```


<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

`````suggestion
    function _komodoOnMessageHandler(messageEvent) {
      // Only accept messages from our trusted iframe origin
      const iframeSrc = document.getElementById('fiat-onramp-iframe').src;
      const trustedOrigin = new URL(iframeSrc).origin;
      if (messageEvent.origin !== trustedOrigin) {
        console.warn('Ignored message from untrusted origin:', messageEvent.origin);
        return;
      }

      let messageData;
      try {
        messageData = typeof messageEvent.data === 'string'
          ? JSON.parse(messageEvent.data)
          : messageEvent.data;
      } catch (parseError) {
        messageData = messageEvent.data;
      }

      // forward navigation requests to parent
      if (messageData && typeof messageData === 'object') {
        if (
          (messageData.type === 'navigation' ||
           messageData.action === 'checkout_complete') &&
          messageData.url
        ) {
          window.location.href = messageData.url;
          return;
        }
`````

</details>

<!-- suggestion_end -->

