Updating the structure of the SaaS examples, Adding spend requirements section, build and markup fixes

This is a subset of the work done in https://github.com/FinOps-Open-Cost-and-Usage-Spec/FOCUS_Spec/pull/688. There's too many things to clean up and push at once in that PR - so breaking it down to a smaller PR. 

@rileyjenk has agreed to this new formatting.

