_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**`loadPersistedState()` adds duplicates every time the dashboard is instantiated**

`filesModel` is static, yet `loadPersistedState()` appends to it on *every* construction of `DashboardPanel`.  
If the application creates more than one dashboard (e.g. undocks/re-docks), recent-file entries will be duplicated indefinitely.

```diff
private void loadPersistedState() {
-    FilePersistance.getRecentFiles().forEach(item -> {
+    filesModel.clear();                       // ← avoid duplication
+    FilePersistance.getRecentFiles().forEach(item -> {
         ...
     });
```



