_⚠️ Potential issue_

**Missing return statement when invoice is found**

The API route successfully queries the database and handles the case when an invoice is not found, but it doesn't return any response when an invoice is found. This will result in hanging requests when a valid invoice ID is provided.


Apply this fix to return the data when an invoice is found:

```diff
  if (!data) {
   return NextResponse.json({ error: "Invoice not found" }, { status: 404 });
  }
+ return NextResponse.json({ data });
}
```


