_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**Avoid boxing `Camera2D`; store it directly in `Resources`**  
`Camera2D` is a small `Copy` struct – boxing adds an unnecessary heap allocation and an extra level of indirection.

```diff
-    let camera = Box::new(Camera2D::default());
+    let camera = Camera2D::default();
 …
-    resources.insert(camera);
+    resources.insert(camera);
```
This also simplifies retrieval: `resources.get_mut::<Camera2D>()` instead of working with `Box<…>`.  



