review_comment:
Wrap the JSON.parse call in a try-catch block to gracefully handle malformed package.json files and provide a clear error message.
```suggestion
    let pkg;
    try {
      pkg = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(packageJsonPath, "utf-8"));
    } catch (error) {
      console.error(
        chalk.red("Failed to parse package.json. Please ensure it contains valid JSON."),
      );
      process.exit(1);
    }
```

