Since all of this is sequential and any of the first precompiles fail, then the whole `testPrecompiles()` fail. I think it would be better to create something like
```
function testShaPrecompile() public {
        executePrecompile("testShaPrecompile", _shaPrecompile);
    }

    function testEcRecoverPrecompile() public {
        executePrecompile("testEcRecoverPrecompile", _ecRecoverPrecompile);
    }
  ```

