review_comment:
_⚠️ Potential issue_

**Address the confusing `void` union type.**

Per the static analysis hint, returning `Promise<void | T>` can be replaced by `Promise<T | undefined>` for clarity. This improves type-safety and eliminates ambiguity around potential return values.  

```diff
- handler: <T>(filter: Filter) => Promise<void | T>,
+ handler: <T>(filter: Filter) => Promise<T | undefined>,
```


<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

`````suggestion
  async traverseFilters(
    filters: Filter[],
    handler: <T>(filter: Filter) => Promise<T | undefined>,
  ) {
    return Promise.all(
      (filters ?? []).map(async (filter) => {
        // somehow filters is an array of array
        if (Array.isArray(filter)) {
          return this.traverseFilters(filter, handler);
        } else if (filter.is_group) {
          return this.traverseFilters(filter.children, handler);
        } else {
          return handler(filter);
        }
      }),
    );
  }
`````

</details>

