**Improve error handling completeness.**

The error handling looks good but is missing a default case for non-Error objects and doesn't guarantee a return value in all code paths. Consider:

```diff
        } catch (error) {
            if (error instanceof TRPCError) throw error;

            if (error instanceof Error) {
                throw new TRPCError({
                    code: "INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR",
                    message: error.message
                })
+           } else {
+               throw new TRPCError({
+                   code: "INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR",
+                   message: "An unknown error occurred"
