pr_body:
# Patch Notes

## Impacted GHI

 - [x] Closes #338
 - [ ] Opens #403

## Changes

Changes in file .github/workflows/CI-DOCS.yml:
 * similar changes for documentation generation in CI/CD

Additions with file .github/actions/setup-py-reqs/action.yml:
 * ✨ New action for handling python pip installs in CI/CD

Changes in file .github/workflows/Tests.yml:
 * improved summary reporting for CI/CD tests
 * integrated new GHA template
 * related work

Changes in file Makefile:
 * attempt to make build target less pre-emptive
 * related work


### New CI Testing Dependency Graph

```mermaid
graph TD;
    PUSH-EVENT-->CI-Build.yml;
    CI-Build.yml-->Build-Artifact.whl;
    CI-Build.yml-->Build-Info-Artifact.txt;
    CI-Build.yml-->Build-Summary-Artifact.txt;
    Build-Artifact.whl-->CI-MATs.yml;
    Build-Info-Artifact.txt-->CI-MATs.yml;
    CI-MATs.yml-->MATs-Info-Artifact.txt;
    CI-MATs.yml-->MATs-Summary-Artifact.txt;
    Build-Artifact.whl-->CI-Tests.yml;
    MATs-Info-Artifact.txt-->CI-Tests.yml;
    CI-Tests.yml-->COVERAGE-Artifact.zip;
    CI-Tests.yml-->Test-Results-Artifact.zip;
    CI-Tests.yml-->Test-Summary-Artifact.txt;
    Build-Artifact.whl-->CI-DOCs.yml;
    MATs-Info-Artifact.txt-->CI-DOCs.yml;
    CI-DOCs.yml-->Documentation-Artifact.zip;
```


<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->

## Summary by CodeRabbit

- **New Features**
    - Introduced a GitHub Action to automate Python dependency installation and artifact management.
    - Enhanced CI workflows with detailed integration and documentation test reporting, including summary artifacts and commit comments.
- **Improvements**
    - CI workflows now use explicit dependency installation steps and improved artifact handling.
    - Makefile updated for streamlined installation targets and exclusion of additional files in packaging.
    - Improved Python version handling in minimal acceptance tests action.
    - Extended spell-checking with additional known typo detection.
- **Bug Fixes**
    - Fixed HTML summary formatting in CI reports.
    - Removed redundant permissions and obsolete steps in workflows.
<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->

