+/**
+ * User Status-related endpoints: getUserStatus, updateUserStatus
+ *
+ * API commands:
+ * - user_show: https://freeipa.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/user_show.html
+ *   Used to retrieve user data including inetuserstatus attribute
