_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**Ensure customer data exists before accessing properties.**

The code retrieves conformities and customer info but doesn't fully validate that the data exists before accessing properties.


```diff
    const conformities = await sendCoreMessage({
      subdomain,
      action: "conformities.findConformities",
      data: {
        mainType: "deal",
        mainTypeId: { $in: order._id },
      },
      isRPC: true,
      defaultValue: [],
    });

    if (conformities.length > 0) {
      const msdCustomerInfo = await getMsdCustomerInfo(
        subdomain,
        models,
        conformities[0].relTypeId,
        conformities[0].relType,
        brandId,
        config
      );

-      if (msdCustomerInfo) {
+      if (msdCustomerInfo && msdCustomerInfo.relation) {
        msdCustomer = msdCustomerInfo.relation?.response;
        customer = msdCustomerInfo.customer;
      }
    }
```


